  m_Name: bakery-2-post
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  headline: The Flower Fields
  article: 'Amongst the turmoil of the scarecrow onslaught, a beacon of hope has
    arrived for our farmers, as our reporters have retrieved an ancient map written
    in Dryadic, the language of plants.


    Herbolinguists from the farmers guild
    have marked out what appears to be the distant homeland of the dastardy scarecrows
    that are holding our fields hostage.


    While the translation is unclear,
    it goes on to describe a <i>''field of flowers''</i>. A band of adventurers have
    already embarked to the scarecrows'' homeland to take care of this denim clad
    sourge for good!'
